# AstroBlog — Environment Variables
#
# Copy this file to .env.local and fill in values for local development.
# .env.local is gitignored and should never be committed.
#
# Variables marked [PUBLIC] are exposed to the browser in the built output.
# Variables marked [BUILD-TIME] are only used during the build process.

# ─── Site Configuration ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────

# Base URL for canonical links, RSS, and sitemap (set automatically in CI)
# SITE=https://ericcarlisle.com

# ─── Contact Form (Required for contact page) ─────────────────────────────────

# [PUBLIC] URL of the Cloudflare Worker that handles form submissions
# Get this from: wrangler deploy --env production (shows the URL)
PUBLIC_CONTACT_API_URL=https://your-worker.your-subdomain.workers.dev

# [PUBLIC] Cloudflare Turnstile site key for CAPTCHA verification
# Get this from: https://dash.cloudflare.com → Turnstile → Create Site Key
# Use test keys (1x00000000000000000000AA) for local development
PUBLIC_TURNSTILE_SITE_KEY=1x00000000000000000000AA

# ─── Webmentions (Optional) ───────────────────────────────────────────────────

# [BUILD-TIME] Token for webmention.io API
# Without this, mock webmention data is used in dev and omitted in production
# Get this from: https://webmention.io/settings
# WEBMENTION_IO_TOKEN=your-token-here

# ─── Sentry Error Tracking (Optional) ─────────────────────────────────────────
# NOTE: Sentry is installed but not configured. See docs/deployment.md for
# enablement steps if needed in the future.

# ─── Notes ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
#
# Cloudflare Worker secrets are configured separately via Wrangler:
#   cd contact-worker && wrangler secret put TURNSTILE_SECRET_KEY
#   cd contact-worker && wrangler secret put RESEND_API_KEY
#   cd contact-worker && wrangler secret put RESEND_FROM_EMAIL
#   cd contact-worker && wrangler secret put RESEND_TO_EMAIL
#
# GitHub Actions uses repository variables (not secrets) for:
#   PUBLIC_TURNSTILE_SITE_KEY
#   PUBLIC_CONTACT_API_URL
#
# See docs/deployment.md for full deployment documentation.
